# Build output. This crate is a guest-image artifact, so the release binary is
# built when the image is built, never committed.
/target/

# The harness's own runtime state, written when it is run in-tree (bench, a
# smoke test, a hand run). It is per-run bookkeeping, not source, and a stale
# session file in a repository is misleading about what has been run.
/.aiec-agent/
